RUMOR — interactive installation software

This project combines:
  - UMBRAL / glow-granular-synth DSP and serial control (original authors)
  - PaulXStretch extreme time-stretch DSP (vendored subset)

When built with PaulXStretch enabled (default), the combined binary is
distributed under the GNU General Public License version 3, as required by
PaulXStretch. See third_party/paulxstretch/LICENSE for upstream terms
(GPL-3 with App Store section 7 exception).

You should have received a copy of the GNU General Public License along with
this program. If not, see <https://www.gnu.org/licenses/>.

Builds with -DRUMOR_WITH_PAULXSTRETCH=OFF exclude the PaulXStretch sources;
licensing of those builds follows the remaining components only.
